元年，以母憂去職。筠有孝性，毀瘠過禮。中大通二年，爲司徒左長史。三年，昭明太子薨，敕制哀策文，復見嗟賞。尋出爲臨海太守，在郡侵刻，還資有芒屩兩舫，他物稱是。爲有司奏，不調累年。後曆秘書監，太府卿，度支尚書，司徒左長史。及簡文即位，爲太子詹事。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p005:m0049"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"中大通三年。《梁書》八記四月乙巳薨，五月庚寅葬。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"le-nanshi022-wangyun-family-wyd-164-53","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","event_type":"death","source_term":"薨","date_expression":null,"source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p005","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"薨"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd1739","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p005","quote":"後為太子家令復掌管記普通元年以母憂去職筠有孝性毀瘠過禮大通二年為司徒左長史三年昭明太子薨敕製哀策文復見嗟賞尋出為臨海太守在郡侵刻還資有芒屩兩舫他物稱是為有司奏不調累年後歷祕書監太府卿度支尚書司徒左長史及簡文卽位為太子詹事","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p005:m0039"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"殿本此傳在「大通二年」下承三年；梁書本傳記中大通三年薨。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p001:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"統","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"太子統之名，與南史所稱昭明太子同。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes"},{"id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p001:m0004","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"統","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依原句明名及所屬傳文。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun"},{"id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p001:m0006","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"德施","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依原句明名及所屬傳文。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong