d":"b-liangshu-008","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun-ws1538023"},{"id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p002:r0047","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p002","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"我","referent_role":"speaker_self","quote":"三年三月，寢疾。恐貽高祖憂，敕參問，輒自力手書啓。及稍篤，左右欲啓聞，猶不許，曰「云何令至尊知我如此惡」，因便嗚咽。四月乙巳薨，時年三十一。高祖幸東宮，臨哭盡哀。詔斂以袞冕。諡曰昭明。五月庚寅，葬安寧陵。詔司徒左長史王筠爲哀冊文曰：","note":"由本篇稱呼、世代及話語視點核對。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun","book_id":"b-liangshu-008","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun-ws1538023"},{"id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p002:r0089","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun:p002","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"昭明","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"三年三月，寢疾。恐貽高祖憂，敕參問，輒自力手書啓。及稍篤，左右欲啓聞，猶不許，曰「云何令至尊知我如此惡」，因便嗚咽。四月乙巳薨，時年三十一。高祖幸東宮，臨哭盡哀。詔斂以袞冕。諡曰昭明。五月庚寅，葬安寧陵。詔司徒左長史王筠爲哀冊文曰：","note":"由本篇稱呼、世代及話語視點核對。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun","book_id":"b-liangshu-008","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-008-xiaotong-wangyun-ws1538023"},{"start":109,"end":113,"surface":"昭明太子","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:r0109","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"子微字玄度，美風采，好學善屬文，位兼中書舍人。與河東裴子野、沛國劉顯同官友善。時魏中山王元略還北，梁武帝餞於武德殿，賦詩三十韻，限三刻成。微二刻便就，文甚美，帝再覽焉。又爲臨汝侯猷制放生文，亦見賞於世。後除尙書左丞。及昭明太子薨，帝立晉安王綱爲皇太子，將出詔，唯召尙書右僕射何敬容、宣惠將軍孔休源及微三人與議。微時年位尙輕，而任遇已重。後卒於北中郎豫章王長史、南蘭陵太守。文集二十卷。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指蕭統。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762"},{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004:r0041","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"太子","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"累遷太子洗馬中舍人並掌東宮管記昭明太子愛文學士常與筠及劉孝綽陸倕到洽殷鈞等遊宴玄圃太子獨執筠袖撫孝綽肩曰所謂左把浮丘袖右拍洪崖肩其見重如此筠又與殷鈞以方雅見禮後為中書郎奉敕製開善寺寶誌法師碑文辭甚麗逸又敕撰中書表奏三十卷及所上賦頌都為一集","note":"同段昭明太子蕭統。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:r0049","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"太子","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"累遷太子洗馬，中舍人，並掌東宮管記。昭明太子愛文學士，常與筠及劉孝綽、陸倕、到洽、殷鈞等游宴玄圃，太子獨執筠袖，撫孝綽肩曰：「所謂左把浮丘袖，右拍洪崖肩。」其見重如此。筠又與殷鈞以方雅見禮。後爲中書郎，奉敕制開善寺寶志法師碑文，辭甚麗逸。又敕撰中書表奏三十卷，及所上賦頌都爲一集。","note":"同段昭明太子蕭統。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-ws1477957"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p001","text":"夏四月乙巳，皇太子統薨。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p001:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"統","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"太子統之名，與南史所稱昭明太子同。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":204,"last_line":204,"revision_id":2401780,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true,"raw_line_start_codepoint":0,"raw_line_end_codepoint":12},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes","book_id":"b-liangshu-003","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes-ws2401780"},{"id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p003","text":"癸丑，立昭明太子子南徐州刺史華容公歡爲豫章郡王","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p003:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"歡","kind":"person","person_id":"yqs_lxt_73d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"昭明太子之子歡受封豫章，原句以下另封譽、察。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":206,"last_line":206,"revision_id":2401780,"editorial_excerpt_bounda